    "updated_at": "2023-08-31T13:01:03Z",
    "body": "No, we need AAA step 4.3 to *not* find `formatting element` with the tag name `subject` to trigger the desired behavior. In this case it finds it. (AAA is called on the second `<nobr>`, so it finds the first `<nobr>` in the list of active formatting elements.)",
