    "body": "I believe this is the test (found by brute force):\r\n```html\r\n<object><a><p><a>\r\n```\r\n**Update**: No, Ladybird tree is the same as Chrome:\r\n```html\r\n<html>\r\n    <head>\r\n    <body>\r\n        <object>\r\n            <a>\r\n            <p>\r\n                <a>\r\n                <a>\r\n```\r\n",
