    "updated_at": "2026-06-19T19:10:26Z",
    "body": "Turns out it is actually a great example, it shows the difference between Ladybird and Chrome too:\nLadybird tree:\n```\n#document\n  <html>\n    <head>\n    <body>\n      <nobr>\n        <marquee>\n        <table>\n        <nobr>\n```\n@zcorpan this is the test you were asking for\n\n<s>Since Chrome behaves the same as Live DOM Viewer by Ian Hickson himself,</s> *(oops, Live DOM Viewer just displays the browser's DOM)* \nI am assuming Chrome behavior is the correct one, and I would like the text to be clarified [like this](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9559#issuecomment-1677793355).",
