    "body": "> Doesn't the Live DOM Viewer use the current DOM from the browser in which it's open?\n\nYes, this is correct. The HTML is loaded into an iframe, then it's inspected. It reports the tree as rendered by the current browser.\n\n> you found a really cool test\n\nThank you 😎",
